
<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی سکینہ (ص)/کہتی تھی رن میں آ کے سکینہ جواب دو</div>

<p>kehti thi ran me aake sakina jawaab do<br />
jaan-e nabi-o faatema zehra jawaab do<br />
kyu so rahe ho qaak pa tanha jawaab do<br />
aayi hu tumko dhoondh ne is jaa jawaab do</p>

<p>marti hoo'n gham se mere masiha jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zaqmi huwe hai kaan mere chingaye gohar<br />
kis se kahoo'n ke zaqmo'n me hai dard peshtar<br />
faryaad tumse karne mai aayi hoo'n aye pidar<br />
hai qaabil-e mulaaheza ye haal sar basar</p>

<p>dekho ye qoo'n bhara huwa kurta jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qaidi banaake shaam ko le jaate hai hame<br />
pursaa'n nahi hai koi ke kuch us se ham kahe'n<br />
faryaad ghamzado'n ki na hazrat bhi gar sune'n<br />
kab tak in aafato'n me rahe'n aah kya kare'n</p>

<p>kya keh rahi hoo'n syed-e waala jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>be gor kyu pade hai tumhaare rafeeq sab<br />
laasha ye jalti ret pa mai dekhti hu jab<br />
hota hai mere dil pa do baala ghamo ta'ab<br />
dafnata inko koi nahi is ka kya sabab</p>

<p>kyu bekafan har ek ka hai laasha jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aati hai daadi jaan ki aawaaz yaa'n suno<br />
kis dard se pukarti hai baba jaa'n suno<br />
karti hai kaise ranj-o alam ke bayaa'n suno<br />
kya so rahe ho binte nabi ki fughaa'n suno</p>

<p>kis minnatou se kehti hai zehra jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye jaane faatema o payambar utho utho<br />
aye noor-e ain-e faateh-e khaibar utho utho<br />
dekho aseer hogayi qaahar utho utho<br />
chilla rahi hai aap ki duqtar utho utho</p>

<p>kya so rahe ho beti ke shaida jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pooche jo mujh se fatima soughra to kya kahu<br />
pyaase shaheed hogaye baba bayaa'n karu<br />
akbar ka mai ne dekha hai laasha bayaa'n karu<br />
asghar ka sar bhi naize pa dekha bayaa'n karu</p>

<p>kya keh ke usko doo'n mai dilaasa jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rote the aap mai jo kabhi karti thi fughaa'n<br />
samjha ke leke god me karte the yu bayaa'n<br />
qurbaan tere aankho'n ke aansu na kar rawaa'n<br />
ab mera rona aur ye gham khaana baba jaa'n</p>

<p>kyu aapko huwa hai gawaara jawaab do<br />
baba jawaab do mere baba jawaab do<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>